msgid "Prošlo je nedelju dana otkad je paket stigao — taman dovoljno da se peškirići okače, isprobaju i operu bar jednom."
msgstr "A week has passed since the parcel arrived — just enough time to hang the towels, try them out and wash them at least once."

msgid "Ako imaš minut, ostavi kratku recenziju. Pomaže drugima da izaberu, a nama da znamo šta da pravimo sledeće."
msgstr "If you have a minute, leave a short review. It helps others choose, and it tells us what to make next."

